      ],
      "en": "In his day you shall give him his wages, neither shall the sun go down on it, for he is poor and sets his heart on it, lest he cry against you to the LORD, and it be sin to you.",
      "ko": "그 품삯을 당일에 주고 해진 후까지 끌지 말라 이는 그가 빈궁하므로 마음에 품삯을 사모함이라 두렵건대 그가 너를 여호와께 호소하면 죄가 네게로 돌아갈까 하노라",
      "source_text_hash": "144a6c2f0f511171d5a12026b78a74bace65b1c86e4cefb4a2807d02d4ba8ce1",
      "translation_text_hash": "0e2fe9f8e748e86f962a9f916c42474d22dcf4d8d56e3b867e5fc9a98f0acbea",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
