      "en": "The fathers shall not be put to death for the children, neither shall the children be put to death for the fathers. Every man shall be put to death for his own sin.",
      "ko": "아비는 그 자식들을 인하여 죽임을 당치 않을 것이요 자식들은 그 아비를 인하여 죽임을 당치 않을 것이라 각 사람은 자기 죄에 죽임을 당할 것이니라",
      "source_text_hash": "44af262473e445641c25b5ebbd471483b3846f9c8039073ead1645b28c39cbfd",
      "translation_text_hash": "0cef63c8e630bc2561512d643cb3d548a8baddb7df24be6434b60aab3b0b2247",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
