      "en": "You shall not deprive the foreigner or the fatherless of justice, nor take a widow’s clothing in pledge;",
      "ko": "너는 객이나 고아의 송사를 억울하게 말며 과부의 옷을 전집하지 말라",
      "source_text_hash": "cf50795df0024ecf784346abe8d809619fa77cde22b431ad67057f2b8e617a0f",
      "translation_text_hash": "6648f74e0c159d1d6127929614e1583f8e9a0d760012b6cfea978e39a9faa284",
